{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14939","headline":"九日奉陪侍郎登白楼 · 卢纶","name":"九日奉陪侍郎登白楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧霄孤鹤发清音，上宰因添望阙心。\n睥睨三层连步障，茱萸一朵映华簪。\n红霞似绮河如带，白露团珠菊散金。\n此日所从何所问，俨然冠剑拥成林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14939.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14939","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}